        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Wilson, Chino Moreno, Colin James\n- Bands and Projects: The Fabulous Thunderbirds, Deftones, Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, Palms, My Kind Of Evil\n- Songs: \"Tuff Enuff\", \"Wrap It Up\"\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Wilson is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman for The Fabulous Thunderbirds on the 1980s hit songs \"Tuff Enuff\" and \"Wrap It Up.\"\n- Chino Moreno, born Camillo Wong Moreno on June 20, 1973, is an American musician.\n- Chino Moreno is best known as the lead vocalist and contributing guitarist of Deftones.\n- Chino Moreno is also a member of the side-project groups Team Sleep, Crosses, Saudade, and Palms.\n- My Kind Of Evil was produced by multi-Grammy nominee Kim Wilson, who is a singer for The Fabulous Thunderbirds, and it features fellow Canadian Colin James on two tracks.",
